image-process internal GStreamer runtime

The CDG0.0 framing/parser and image-directory source behavior were refactored
from the MSF project at revision c4046d66a60da97cf4b28d20b9cedd9a9bffb254.
The reviewed upstream declares the project license as MIT. Detailed path-level
decisions and explicit exclusions are recorded in SOURCE_PROVENANCE.json.

The metadata ABI and ImageFilterTest compatibility element are new
image-process implementations. No GPL-marked DeepSort/Munkres/matrix source or
LGPL-marked MSF generic meta/property implementation is included.

The optional Lynxi YOLO detector copies the MSF `subprojects/lynxi` C++ wrapper
and infer post-process (Lynxi Technologies Co., Ltd. proprietary headers) into
`src/backends/lynxi/`. It is built only when `-Dlynxi=enabled` and a userspace
SDK prefix is present. Model blobs under `data/lynxi_models/` are not part of
the source bundle.
